  Why: 'Out of the Heath Pond, through the dune''s notch and across the main beach (ground.stp_main_beach, the 10-01 beach): its bed is the ask''s, cut into the beach. It ends at the shore near (11.76, -78.15), where its bed crosses mean tide, so the sea owns its mouth (amendment 2 §4.2).'
